<title>HONG KONG: Wah Shing declares first interim results.</title>
<headline>Wah Shing declares first interim results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  9.3    vs 9.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   5.5    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   34.85  vs 32.85</p>
<p>    Turnover		    420.59 vs 321.28</p>
<p>    Company name		Wah Shing International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 October 10-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  October 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Toy maker Wah Shing was listed on the Stock Exchange of Singapore on January 19, 1996. The comparative figures are presented on the basis of merger accounting reflecting a group restructing in December 1995.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on a weighted average of 374.24 million shares vs 340 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
